import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 574 | Acceleration Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Weaving","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 574 | Acceleration Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Weaving","no":574,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","World-Creation Realm","Law Weaving","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0574_模块3-加速域-创世境适配.md","filePath":"en/0574_模块3-加速域-创世境适配.md"}'),n={name:"en/0574_模块3-加速域-创世境适配.md"};function r(l,e,s,d,c,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-574-acceleration-domain-world-creation-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-weaving" tabindex="-1">Entry 574 | Acceleration Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Weaving <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-574-acceleration-domain-world-creation-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-weaving" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 574 | Acceleration Domain | World-Creation Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Weaving&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 80; Benchmark library: Entry 573</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-leap-from-reading-law-to-weaving-law" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the leap from &quot;reading law&quot; to &quot;weaving law&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-leap-from-reading-law-to-weaving-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the leap from &quot;reading law&quot; to &quot;weaving law&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After Boundary-Breaking, the cultivator enters World-Creation. This realm&#39;s core task is <strong>weaving law</strong> (Document 14): no longer reading existing law, fusing existing law, but in empty isolated space, from zero designing a self-consistent law system, creating a runnable small world. World-Creation is the sage-cultivation four realms&#39; third realm, meaning the cultivator already possesses &quot;creator-class&quot; ability.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in World-Creation reach the sage stage&#39;s peak: anti-predation axiom requires world-creation be not &quot;starting a new stove to plunder resources,&quot; but &quot;building a new world in incremental space&quot;; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires world-creation results open to Myriad Ranks for visiting, use; collective ascension axiom requires the created world ultimately become Myriad Ranks&#39; shared dwelling; causal self-discipline axiom requires the created world&#39;s causality completely isolated, not affecting reality; law-first axiom takes &quot;World-Creation adapted flow&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-law-weaving-is-the-acceleration-domain-s-highest-stage" tabindex="-1">I. Why Law Weaving Is the Acceleration Domain&#39;s Highest Stage <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-law-weaving-is-the-acceleration-domain-s-highest-stage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Law Weaving Is the Acceleration Domain&#39;s Highest Stage&quot;">​</a></h2><p>World-Creation&#39;s core task is &quot;doing large-scale engineering design between consciousness and the law network.&quot; This is a composite task of information processing and engineering design, naturally suiting high-multiple acceleration:</p><ul><li>Law clauses are stable; acceleration does not change their structure;</li><li>World-creation design needs repeated trial-and-error; acceleration makes trial-and-error cost drop exponentially;</li><li>Multiplication Fruit Technology has highest amplification efficiency on engineering deduction.</li></ul><p>Thus World-Creation is the nine realms&#39; <strong>best suited to extreme acceleration</strong> realm. The Origin Acceleration Domain opens 1000× to 10000× flow for World-Creation — this is the highest gear among mortal and sage cultivation stages.</p><h2 id="ii-world-creation-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. World-Creation Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-world-creation-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. World-Creation Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Flow</th><th>Output</th><th>Exit Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law Design</td><td>1000–10000×</td><td>Created-world law draft</td><td>Draft self-consistent, no paradox</td></tr><tr><td>World Simulation</td><td>1000×</td><td>Complete world-operation simulation</td><td>Simulate million years without collapse</td></tr><tr><td>Real Solidification</td><td>1×</td><td>Real world in isolated space</td><td>World stably runs</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Opening</td><td>Public</td><td>Myriad Ranks visit, use</td><td>No incident during opening period</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s essence is &quot;extreme design, extreme simulation, real solidification.&quot; In the acceleration domain use 10000× flow, spend a few days designing a draft, simulating million-year operation; after confirming no paradox, at real flow solidify it into a real world in isolated space. This moves engineering&#39;s &quot;simulation—prototype&quot; process into world-creation.</p><h2 id="iii-myriad-rank-co-governance-of-created-worlds" tabindex="-1">III. Myriad-Rank Co-Governance of Created Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-myriad-rank-co-governance-of-created-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Myriad-Rank Co-Governance of Created Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A world created by a World-Creation cultivator is not his private back garden. Per the republican axiom of Myriad Races:</p><ul><li>The world after solidification opens to Myriad Ranks; any being may apply to enter and dwell;</li><li>The creator retains &quot;design rights,&quot; but not &quot;ruling rights&quot; — governance within the world is uniformly handled by the Anchor Council;</li><li>If the created world&#39;s laws have defects, they must be revised per Myriad-Rank feedback.</li></ul><p>This design彻底 negates the old era&#39;s predatory logic of &quot;creating means ruling.&quot; In the predatory-faction system, the strong creating a world is becoming emperor; all beings in it are his private property; in Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the creator is only an architect, not a king.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-creation-as-private-property" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Creation as Private Property&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-creation-as-private-property" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Creation as Private Property&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, a World-Creation strong one&#39;s typical behavior is: create a world, treat it as private territory, do whatever he wants in it. This behavior&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>It places the world-internal beings&#39; evolutionary right under the creator&#39;s personal will;</li><li>The creator&#39;s personal prejudice gets compiled into the world&#39;s laws, manufacturing systematic unfairness;</li><li>It trains &quot;tyrants,&quot; not &quot;architects.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in World-Creation acceleration gear makes &quot;Myriad-Rank opening&quot; a hard precondition of solidification: not open, no permission to solidify into a real world. This rule makes &quot;creation as private property&quot; fundamentally unworkable in process.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: put ten-thousandfold acceleration on the world-creation design segment, best suited to engineering deduction, avoiding wasting the law network on the real-solidification segment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: world-creation proceeds in incremental isolated space, does not plunder existing-plane resources; the world must open to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style world-creation relies on protagonist&#39;s strength to open private heaven and earth; the world is private property; Heng Yuan&#39;s created world is Myriad Ranks&#39; shared dwelling</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have world-creation templates; consciousness-information race&#39;s &quot;concept world,&quot; mechanical race&#39;s &quot;engineering world&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-design algorithm, simulation tools, opening process all public; this is the world-creation segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-myriad-rank-move-in-application-system-for-created-worlds" tabindex="-1">VI. Myriad-Rank Move-In Application System for Created Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-myriad-rank-move-in-application-system-for-created-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Myriad-Rank Move-In Application System for Created Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After a created world solidifies, Myriad Ranks move in via application: any being may apply, but each world has an ecological-capacity ceiling; beyond it must expand. The creator does not select residents, only audits capacity. Residents retain full citizenship, legally completely equal to the creator. This design fundamentally negates the creator&#39;s ruling right over the world — he only builds the house; the Myriad Ranks who move in are the house&#39;s true owners.</p><h2 id="vii-myriad-rank-review-of-world-creation-engineering" tabindex="-1">VII. Myriad-Rank Review of World-Creation Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-myriad-rank-review-of-world-creation-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Myriad-Rank Review of World-Creation Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A created world before real solidification must pass a public review by a Myriad-Rank review panel: the panel examines the design from three dimensions — ecology, ethics, sustainability. Ecologically, is the world-internal energy cycle closed; ethically, are the world-internal Myriad-Rank rights protected; sustainably, can the world bear civilizational development for a long enough time. Any dimension not up to standard, the creator must return to the furnace for redesign. This review turns world-creation from personal art into civilizational engineering, ensuring the world where Myriad Ranks will dwell in future withstands long-term tests.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>World-Creation is the key realm from &quot;using law&quot; to &quot;weaving law.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain here gives the nine realms&#39; highest-multiple flow, because world-creation design the faster the better, the more trial-and-error the better. But acceleration&#39;s precondition is &quot;open to Myriad Ranks as soon as created&quot; — this is precisely Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s most fundamental attitude toward creation: <strong>you may create worlds, but the world does not belong to you.</strong></p><p>In the final analysis, the World-Creation Realm adaptation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./573_模块3-加速域-破界境适配.html">573-Acceleration-Domain Boundary-Breaking Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">80-Plane Theory and Classification</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=a(n,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
